{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7b7a84bd-0d42-42e2-bd43-f741f72f0c70",
    "name": "iCode Back",
    "description": "Endpoints de iCode-back. Se actualiza en el mismo PR que agrega o cambia un endpoint — ver postman/README.md para la convención.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userName\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"Passw0rd1!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Credenciales del seed de dev — ver migrations/README.md. Devuelve un token opaco (NO un JWT), pegalo en la variable de colección \"accessToken\" para que el resto de los requests lo usen solos."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Usuario autenticado + sus permisos efectivos (unión de todos sus roles activos, vista UserPermission)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoca la sesión actual de inmediato (UserSession.RevokedAt) — a diferencia de un JWT, el token deja de servir en el acto, no cuando expira solo. 204 sin body."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Usuarios en línea",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/sessions/online",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "sessions", "online"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere el permiso ADMIN_VIEW_SESSIONS (solo Administrador por defecto). \"En línea\" = actividad en los últimos ONLINE_THRESHOLD_MINUTES (15 por defecto) — no lo mismo que \"sesión activa\" (esas duran 30 días por la expiración deslizante). La ubicación es aproximada por IP (geoip-lite): null en IPs privadas/locales, típico en dev."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "App",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Root",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint de ejemplo del scaffold de Nest. Responde 'Hello World!' en texto plano."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Vía @nestjs/terminus. 200 = { status: 'ok', info: { database: { status: 'up' } }, ... }. 503 si Postgres no responde."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
